~ start
Gatekeeper: You are at the gate. What is your business?
- I came to work the field
	do kapi_etki("is", "tarla")
	Gatekeeper: There is a place in the field. Stay until evening. I will send the next person.
	=> end
- I need water, I have no work
	do kapi_etki("debuff", "su")
	Gatekeeper: Drink. Your work strength falls today; the next person will be spoken to after.
	=> end

~ end
